            </p>

          </div>

        </article>


        <article class="journal-card fade-in">

          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589122125915-17d16a9541c8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85"
            alt="緑の木々"
          >

          <div class="journal-card-content">

